# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Modbus Messaging on TCP/IP Implementation Guide V1.0b (the MBAP header description; section number not checked, the PDF is not retained), wrapped around the Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b section 6.3, Read Holding Registers, request example.
# Transaction 3, protocol id 0, length 6 (unit id plus 5 PDU bytes), unit id 17 (0x11). Read registers 108 to 110.
00 03 00 00 00 06 11 03 00 6B 00 03
